+    // Hard gate 5: Anatomical location contradiction
+    // (Exception: if this is the sole exact FIGO match on the same study and shares wall layer e.g. intramural,
+    // keep as compatible candidate with a location discrepancy note so reconciliation can flag size/location discrepancy)
